# Everything in this repo runs offline with no API keys. Copy this file to `.env` only if you
# want `npm run eval` to hit real models (and run the llm-rubric judge) or export real OTel spans.

# --- Live evals (provider-agnostic) -------------------------------------------------------------
# Prompts declare a *tier* in their frontmatter (prompts/*.md -> model_routing.tier), never a vendor
# model. Map each tier to ANY Promptfoo provider id (https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/providers/).
# Live mode turns on when every tier used by a prompt has a provider set.
#
# Examples (pick one family, or mix):
#   EVAL_PROVIDER_FRONTIER=anthropic:messages:<frontier-model-id>
#   EVAL_PROVIDER_FRONTIER=openai:chat:<frontier-model-id>
#   EVAL_PROVIDER_FRONTIER=google:<frontier-model-id>
#   EVAL_PROVIDER_FRONTIER=ollama:chat:<local-model>        # fully local, no key needed
#
# EVAL_PROVIDER_FRONTIER=
# EVAL_PROVIDER_LIGHTWEIGHT=
# Optional: model used to grade `llm-rubric` assertions (defaults to the frontier provider).
# EVAL_PROVIDER_JUDGE=

# Then set whichever credential your chosen provider reads, e.g.:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# --- Observability -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: send OpenTelemetry spans to an OTLP HTTP collector instead of local traces/runs.jsonl
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318/v1/traces
